    situation: 'You are a customer success manager at {company}. {p2}, the operations head at a key account, has asked for the third time for {product} to export reports in a format their legacy finance system reads. Each month {p2}\'s team spends two days reformatting exports by hand. The product team has confirmed the format is not on the roadmap for at least a year, because only two customers use that system. {p2} has written that "if the export is not fixed by the renewal we will look elsewhere." The renewal is in four months and the account is worth 8 percent of your book. You know that a partner has built a middleware connector for another customer with a similar system, which would cost {p2} about 6,000 a year. You have a call with {p2} this afternoon.',
