    modelAnswer: 'I would start with the problem as {p2} experiences it: two days a month of manual reformatting so their finance system can read our reports, three requests, and a renewal decision hanging on it. Then I would be straight: the native export is not on our roadmap for at least a year, because only two customers use that system, and I would rather say that than hint otherwise. Then the resolution: a partner has built a connector for a similar system; I would propose setting up a trial in the next three weeks at our cost so their team can test it before any commitment, and if it works it costs about 6,000 a year, which is far less than two days of a team every month. I would also log the request with the product team with the revenue attached. I would confirm a follow up date.',
